      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i just got back from a 13 hour flight from singapore to london yesterday and im feeling kinda weird. im super out of breath just walking to the kitchen and my right calf is kinda aching and feels tight. is this just like jet lag or travel fatigue? i feel exhausted.",
