      "content": "It sounds like you could be experiencing a combination of jet lag and travel fatigue. The exhausting flight, especially a 13-hour one, along with crossing multiple time zones, can definitely contribute to your symptoms. Make sure you do gentle exercises to alleviate post-flight muscle tension and consider hydration and nutritious food to help recover. It's likely temporary, but don't hesitate to seek medical advice if the symptoms persist or worsen.",
      "source": "target",
